<title>BELGIUM: Van Der Moolen Fox as Cockerill options trader.</title>
<headline>Van Der Moolen Fox as Cockerill options trader.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BEL-20 options market maker Van Der Moolen Fox BV will on Tuesday become designated market maker in options on Cockerill, the Belgian futures and options exchange, Belfox, said on Monday.</p>
<p>The designated market maker is a market maker in equity options who provides permanent buy and sell prices for an option in a specific share.</p>
<p>Other market makers in equity options are AOT Belgium, Corluy, Deeway, Servais, KB-Securities, Nedee, Petercam, Puilaetco and Timber Hill Deutschland.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
